0f&oh=00_Af9jT2qDJ8D_pT52O8wzfsXEAgWZnY17UYmte0uYI3mTSg&oe=6A26CA89"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "racerNEWCOVER.png", "id": "1031612920966816", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031582_1031612924300149_4984822269060331165_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mlcXrQ8sE7AQ7kNvwEQda5N&_nc_oc=AdpwpOwxC2peKWM1SDXUkMuE3Su7sVvaMk3-Fba2UQS0Br0XI8A5V6WD8XtXE-M5H9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_tync9RQ0ShLzQTWl4wDoPhzeqc4rZadIb6Sqre121TA&oe=6A26EE32"}, "display_name": "Pocket Racer : Sandbox Engine", "keywords": [], "long_description": "A CREATIVE SANDBOX TO CREATE\n\nPocket Racer : Sandbox Edition give you the freedom to:\n\n- Create your own tracks from 100 prefab sections\n- Choose from 8 different vehicles, including monster trucks, indy cars and motorbikes\n- Race in first-person (grab the virtual wheel) or miniature (micromachine, Hot Wheel or RC Car scale) \n- Publish your own tracks online for others to race and compete for lap records\n- View replays of all other racers who have completed a race on your tracks.\n\n\nImagine your wildest driving fantasy... build whatever you want with a large selection of track pieces, ramps, half pipes, portals, speed boosters, ice tracks and more!  Experiment with your own creations using the 5 default save slots and when you are ready you can publish your track online. Invite other players and compete to be the king of your own creation!\n\nCuriousVR is a solo gamedev and this project is in active development. Feel free to reach out with feature request, comments and concerns.\n \n", "short_description": "Pocket Racer is a competitive online racing sim and track builder. Choose from 8 different vehicles, build your own tracks and race online against other players!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://curiousvrlabs.wixsite.com/home/general-8", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "p